msgid "=== \"Base environment\""
msgstr "=== \"基础环境\""

msgid "## 4.3 Build from a Base Environment {: #base-environment }"
msgstr "## 4.3 从基础环境开始构建 {: #base-environment }"

msgid ""
"This path is intended for advanced users who need to manage the userspace "
"software stack themselves."
msgstr "这条路径适合需要自行控制 userspace 软件栈的高级用户。"

msgid "You can:"
msgstr "可以："

msgid ""
"- install on an existing Linux host;\n"
"    - or start with a minimal Linux container, then install CANN and vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"- 在现有 Linux Host 上完成安装；\n"
"    - 或先进入一个最小 Linux 容器，再安装 CANN 和 vLLM Ascend。"

msgid "### 4.3.1 Prepare the Base System {: #base-environment-prepare }"
msgstr "### 4.3.1 准备基础系统 {: #base-environment-prepare }"

msgid "For example, use Ubuntu 22.04:"
msgstr "例如使用 Ubuntu 22.04："

msgid "!!! important \"Device and driver mounts\""
msgstr "!!! important \"设备与 driver mount\""

msgid ""
"For a minimal container to access the NPU, you must still map the device "
"nodes and host driver files required by the target hardware into the "
"container."
msgstr ""
"最小容器要真正访问 NPU 时，仍需把目标硬件所需的 device node 和 Host\n"
"        driver 文件映射进容器。"

msgid ""
"Device mappings differ between hardware products, so this base environment "
"example does not present a single `docker run` command as universally "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
"不同硬件的 device mapping 不完全一致，因此本基础环境示例不伪装成一个\n"
"        所有硬件都可直接复制的 `docker run` 命令。"

msgid ""
"If you need to install CANN in the container, add the appropriate device and"
" driver mounts according to the official CANN/container documentation for "
"the target hardware."
msgstr ""
"如果需要在容器内安装 CANN，请按照目标硬件的官方 CANN/container 文档\n"
"        添加对应 device 和 driver mount。"

msgid "### 4.3.2 Install CANN {: #base-environment-install-cann }"
msgstr "### 4.3.2 安装 CANN {: #base-environment-install-cann }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_cann.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_cann.inc.md\" %}"

msgid ""
"### 4.3.3 Install vLLM and vLLM Ascend {: #base-environment-install-vllm }"
msgstr "### 4.3.3 安装 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend {: #base-environment-install-vllm }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_vllm_ascend.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/install_vllm_ascend.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "### 4.3.4 Verify the Installation {: #base-environment-verify }"
msgstr "### 4.3.4 验证安装 {: #base-environment-verify }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/installation/verify_installation.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/installation/verify_installation.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "### 4.3.5 Completion Criteria {: #base-environment-complete }"
msgstr "### 4.3.5 完成标准 {: #base-environment-complete }"

msgid ""
"This path is complete after the CANN, NPU tensor operation, vLLM Ascend "
"plugin registration, and core dependency checks all pass."
msgstr ""
"CANN、NPU tensor operation、vLLM Ascend plugin registration 和核心依赖检查\n"
"    全部通过后，本路径完成。"
